s=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>S.B.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-54px;\r\ntop:629px;width:1039px;height:631px'><img width=831 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhDwQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQAOBAEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8fyUQAAOw==\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h2 align=center style='text-align:center'><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGINE<\/span><\/u><\/h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DOPPLER\r\nEVALUATION OF RENAL ARTERIES\u00a0 - DR SB<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Both kidneys are normal in size, shape and\r\nposition. Cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\ndifferentiation. No calculus\/solid mass\/hydronephrosis\/cyst noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Right kidney measures ____ mm\u00a0 x ____\u00a0 mm\r\n(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Left kidney measures ____ mm\u00a0 x ____\u00a0 mm\r\n(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Both renal arteries are well traceable from\r\ntheir origin. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>No obvious narrowing noted at renal\r\narterial ostia. Renal arterial spectral parameters are within normal limits. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Intra-renal vessels shows normal flow\r\npattern in doppler evaluation. Intra-renal vessels show normal spectral\r\nparameters as well as distribution pattern. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>IMPRESSION: <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Doppler Evaluation of Bilateral Renal\r\nArteries and Interlobar Branches show No Obvious Abnormality.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nDISCLAIMER:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af\u00af<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Renal Doppler is only a screening test to\r\nexclude renal artery stenosis - showing relatively good sensitivity and\r\nspecificity. However, CT\/Catheter Angiography is a better investigation when\r\nclinical suspicion persists.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>S.B.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658752;left:-54px;\r\ntop:835px;width:1039px;height:838px'><img width=831 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhDwQDAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQAOBAEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8fyUQAAOw==\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h2 align=center style='text-align:center'><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGINE<\/span><\/u><\/h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DOPPLER\r\nEVALUATION OF RENAL VEINS<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Both\r\nkidneys are normal in size, shape and position. Cortical echotexture is normal\r\nwith preserved cortico-medullary differentiation. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>No\r\ncalculus\/ solid mass\/hydronephrosis noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Both\r\nrenal veins are well traceable. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Renal\r\nvenous flow parameters are within normal limits. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Intra-renal\r\nvessels show distribution from pole to pole. Intra-renal venous tributaries are\r\nshowing normal spectral parameters.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>IMPRESSION:\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<ul style='margin-top:0cm' type=disc>\r\n <li class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Doppler\r\n     evaluation of renal veins is within normal limits at present.<\/span><\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.5pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 31.5pt"}}